{"id":"n88353-11-8","stage":0,"title":"놀다 · 活动","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n88353-11-8-1","ko":"넌 요즘 보통 어디에서 친구를 만나거나 시간을 보내니?","zh":"你最近一般都在哪里和朋友见面或者消磨时间？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"넌","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보통","meaning":"普通，一般","explanation":"보통：普通，一般","readings":[{"term":"보통","audio":"/audio/666599febd987f532ea6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65572","senseId":"1","lemma":"보통","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디에서","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"친구를","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만나거나","meaning":"见面，相逢","explanation":"만나다：见面，相逢；거나：表示选择；与疑问词合用时可表示“无论、任何”。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"2","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시간을","meaning":"时间，空儿","explanation":"시간：时间，空儿；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"3","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보내니?","meaning":"度过","explanation":"보내다：度过；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"보내다","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66375","senseId":"7","lemma":"보내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"666599febd987f53","term":"보통","zh":"普通，一般","audio":"/audio/666599febd987f532ea6.mp3","entryId":"65572","definition":"一般性地；或指通常。","pronunciation":["보ː통"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"见面，相逢","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"其中一人来或去，二人因而相见。","pronunciation":["만나다"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"时间，空儿","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"做某事的空闲。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"8af300ffd85ed5a1","term":"보내다","zh":"度过","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3","entryId":"66375","definition":"让时间流逝。","pronunciation":["보내다"]}],"audio":"/audio/596594b1bf566787e8a2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n88353-11-8-2","ko":"난 시내에서 주로 놀아.","zh":"我主要在市区玩。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"난","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시내에서","meaning":"市内，市里","explanation":"시내：市内，市里；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[